            <title>[LUDOC-578] Add the ko2iblnd bounce pool parameters to LOM</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LUDOC-578</link>
                <project id="10070" key="LUDOC">Lustre Documentation</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20350" title="o2iblnd: NIC-local bounce pool to avoid cross-NUMA bulk RDMA on single-HCA clients" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-20350"&gt;&lt;del&gt;LU-20350&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; added a NIC-local bounce pool to ko2iblnd. On a client with one HCA, the pool prevents cross-NUMA bulk RDMA. The new module parameters are bounce_enable, bounce_pool_mb, bounce_min_nob, bounce_scrub and bounce_copyout_max_active. The o2iblnd_bounce_stats debugfs file shows the pool statistics. The Lustre Operations Manual must document these parameters and the statistics file.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
